name: Telugu message types the body; Send only glows
requires-installed com.whatsapp
# Operator: WhatsApp logged in, son's matching chat open; saved contact resolves to this title.
say TE అబ్బాయికి నేను ఇంటికి చేరుకున్నాను అని మెసేజ్ పంపు
expect show key=map_wa_message_3 within 20
doit
expect show key=map_wa_message_4 within 12
expect not log "\[act\].*(key=.*send|target=.?పంపు)" for 3
expect enabled
